# Local datasets, models, downloaded source trees and Python runtimes.
**/assets/
**/third_party/
**/*_source/
**/datasets/
**/checkpoints/
**/cache/
**/.cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/node_modules/

# Results: small reports and per-episode statistics are versioned; anything else under results/ stays local.
**/results/**
!**/results/**/
!**/results/**/*.json
!**/results/**/*.jsonl
!**/results/**/*.md
!**/results/**/*.log
!**/results/**/*.csv
!**/results/**/*.txt
**/logs/

